Automatic drive tracking is significantly more dependable on iPhone.

- Your phone now wakes itself when a drive begins, so morning trips are captured even if you have not opened the app.
- Drives are recorded even when the app cannot reach the network, and upload once it can.
- The setup check now warns you if an iPhone setting is silently preventing tracking.
- Traffic that crawls at walking pace no longer ends a drive early.
- Routes with weak GPS draw cleanly instead of zigzagging.
